    "created_at": "2024-01-26T23:11:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-26T23:11:02Z",
    "body": "I think this needs the \"toggle task tracker\" concept used in details elements in order to coalesce async toggle events: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#queue-a-details-toggle-event-task\r\n\r\nIf you do this and open+close the dialog element synchronously , there should be one \"toggle\" event with both oldState and newState set to \"closed\":\r\n```javascript\r\ndialog.showModal();\r\ndialog.close();\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
