    "created_at": "2024-04-05T09:24:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-05T09:24:21Z",
    "body": "Hi, this implementation could help us improve a popup, such as a CMP, for better integration by utilizing native browser APIs, specifically the Popover API, to make everything more robust. This will enable us to further improve the INP impact, as described in my case study here: https://web.dev/case-studies/pubconsent-inp?hl=en. Since the CMP is a predominant component on the web, I believe this kind of implementation should be supported as much as possible. I hope it helps. Thank you",
    "author_association": "NONE",
